  "note": "Final A1 review (2026-08-02): work/health vocab on taught preps. praca = pracy in all three slots; biuro/firma regular; na spotkaniu rides neuter -e->-u Loc; szpital exception (-a) taught whole. No new rules beyond the szpital chunk.",
