    {
      "title": "Meetings and hospital",
      "title_pl": "Spotkanie i szpital",
      "body": "Jestem na spotkaniu = I'm in a meeting. Meetings use na, and spotkanie → spotkaniu is the -e → -u ending you know from mieszkanie → mieszkaniu.\n\nSzpital is a rebel: do szpitala, ze szpitala (-a, not -u) — learn it whole. In hospital is regular: w szpitalu.",
